  "description": {
   "en": "Rika, a junior high school teacher who cannot take care of herself, quits her job due to health problems and takes a part-time job at a Chinese restaurant that offers no overtime, no take-home work, and delicious meals.\nRika is a very skilled cook, but the owner, Momose, has a difficult personality.\nBecoming a proper adult is difficult...a healing love story for marginalized girls!"
